<wxs module="UA" src="../../utils/ui-asset.wxs" />
<!-- 照学生的诊断室（pages/diagnosis-room）画：同一个顶栏、底色、气泡和输入框。
     这里是让学生开口复述：对话默认「按住说话」，点左边的键盘也能打字。 -->
<view class="agent-page">
  <view class="agent-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></view>
  <view class="agent-topbar">
    <view class="agent-topbar-inner" style="height: {{navigationBarHeight}}px; padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
      <view class="agent-back-button" bindtap="handleBack" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回">
        <view class="agent-back-icon" aria-hidden="true"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="acc-topbar-heading" style="top: {{statusBarHeight}}px; height: {{navigationBarHeight}}px;">
        <text class="acc-topbar-title">复述验收</text>
        <text wx:if="{{course.title}}" class="acc-topbar-sub">{{course.title}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!loaded && !loadFailed}}" class="acc-skeleton" style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px;" aria-hidden="true">
    <view class="sk acc-skeleton-bubble"></view>
    <view class="sk acc-skeleton-bubble is-user"></view>
    <view class="sk acc-skeleton-bubble is-short"></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{loadFailed}}" class="agent-entry-gate acc-gate" style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px;">
    <text class="agent-entry-gate-title">验收状态暂时没有读到</text>
    <text class="agent-entry-gate-copy">{{errorMessage}}</text>
    <view class="agent-entry-gate-button" bindtap="retry" aria-role="button" aria-label="重新读取">重新读取</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{state === 'learning' || state === 'intro'}}" class="acc-welcome" style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px;">
    <view class="agent-welcome-avatar" aria-hidden="true">
      <view class="agent-welcome-avatar-shape">
        <view class="agent-welcome-eye agent-welcome-eye-left"></view>
        <view class="agent-welcome-eye agent-welcome-eye-right"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{state === 'learning'}}">
      <text class="agent-welcome-title">学完这门课再来验收</text>
      <text class="acc-welcome-copy">已学完 {{acceptance.learning.completed || 0}} / {{acceptance.learning.total || 0}} 部分。全部学完后，把学到的讲给它听。</text>
      <view class="agent-entry-gate-button" bindtap="continueLearning" aria-role="button" aria-label="继续学习">继续学习</view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <text class="agent-welcome-title">把学到的讲给它听</text>
      <text class="acc-welcome-copy">它会像一个没学过这门课的同学一样问你问题，你按住说话，用自己的话讲清楚就好。</text>
      <view class="acc-steps">
        <view class="acc-step"><text class="acc-step-mark">1</text><text>它每次只问一个问题</text></view>
        <view class="acc-step"><text class="acc-step-mark">2</text><text>合上课程凭记忆讲，按住说话，不方便说话也能打字</text></view>
        <view class="acc-step"><text class="acc-step-mark">3</text><text>讲出本课三分之二的要点算通过，老师核验后知识点进入学习宇宙</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="agent-entry-gate-button {{sending ? 'is-busy' : ''}}" bindtap="start" aria-role="button" aria-label="开始验收">{{sending ? '正在准备…' : '开始验收'}}</view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <scroll-view
      class="diagnosis-room-scroll"
      scroll-y
      enhanced
      show-scrollbar="{{false}}"
      scroll-top="{{scrollTop}}"
      scroll-with-animation
      style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px; padding-bottom: {{listBottomPadding}}px;"
    >
      <view class="diagnosis-room-shell">
        <view wx:for="{{turns}}" wx:key="id" class="agent-message agent-message-{{item.role}}">
          <view class="agent-message-column">
            <view class="agent-message-bubble">
              <text class="agent-message-text" user-select="true">{{item.content}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{sending && state === 'chat'}}" class="agent-message agent-message-assistant">
          <view class="agent-message-column">
            <view class="agent-message-bubble is-typing">
              <view class="agent-typing"><view class="typing-dots"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view><text class="agent-typing-label">{{typingLabel}}</text></view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="acc-result is-{{state}}" aria-live="polite">
          <!-- 对话结束后的结论：接在最后一条后面，学生正看着这儿，不用往上翻 -->
          <text class="acc-result-title">{{result.title}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{result.copy}}" class="acc-result-copy">{{result.copy}}</text>
          <view wx:if="{{result.topics.length}}" class="acc-result-topics">
            <text class="acc-result-topics-title">{{result.topicsTitle}}</text>
            <view class="acc-topic-list"><text wx:for="{{result.topics}}" wx:key="name" class="acc-topic">{{item.name}}</text></view>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{result.weakPoints.length}}" class="acc-result-points">
            <text class="acc-result-topics-title">还没讲清的要点</text>
            <text wx:for="{{result.weakPoints}}" wx:key="*this" class="acc-result-point">{{item}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{result.misconceptions.length}}" class="acc-result-points">
            <text class="acc-result-topics-title">说得不对的地方</text>
            <text wx:for="{{result.misconceptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="acc-result-point is-wrong">{{item}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{state === 'passed'}}" class="acc-result-link" bindtap="openUniverse" aria-role="link" aria-label="去宇宙看看">去宇宙看看</view>
          <block wx:if="{{state === 'retry'}}">
            <view class="agent-entry-gate-button acc-result-button {{sending ? 'is-busy' : ''}}" bindtap="start" aria-role="button" aria-label="重新验收">{{sending ? '正在准备…' : '重新验收'}}</view>
            <view class="acc-result-link" bindtap="continueLearning" aria-role="link" aria-label="回到课程复习">回到课程复习</view>
          </block>
        </view>
        <view class="diagnosis-room-bottom"></view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view wx:if="{{voiceRecognizing}}" class="voice-demo-status {{voiceCancel ? 'is-canceling' : ''}}" aria-live="polite">
      <text class="voice-demo-label">{{voiceCancel ? '松手取消' : (voiceRemaining ? '还能说 ' + voiceRemaining + ' 秒，松手发送' : '松手发送，上移取消')}}</text>
      <view class="voice-demo-wave {{voiceSoundActive ? 'is-speaking' : 'is-silent'}}">
        <view wx:for="{{voiceBars}}" wx:key="id" class="voice-demo-bar" style="--bar-height: {{item.height}}; opacity: {{item.opacity}};"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{state === 'chat'}}">
      <view class="agent-composer" style="bottom: {{composerBottomOffset}}px;">
        <view class="agent-composer-bar {{draft ? 'is-input-active' : ''}} {{voiceRecognizing ? 'is-voice-active' : ''}}">
          <view wx:if="{{voiceMode}}" class="agent-voice-button agent-keyboard-button" catchtap="handleKeyboardButtonTap" aria-role="button" aria-label="切换到键盘输入">
            <image class="agent-voice-icon" src="{{UA.src(ui, '../../assets/keyboard-icon.svg')}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"></image>
          </view>
          <view wx:else class="agent-voice-button {{draft ? 'is-collapsing' : ''}}" catchtap="handleVoiceButtonTap" aria-role="button" aria-label="切换到语音输入">
            <image class="agent-voice-icon" src="{{UA.src(ui, '../../assets/agent-voice.svg')}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"></image>
          </view>
          <view
            wx:if="{{voiceMode}}"
            class="agent-voice-speak-button {{sending ? 'is-waiting' : ''}}"
            catchtouchstart="handleSpeakTouchStart"
            catchtouchmove="handleSpeakTouchMove"
            catchtouchend="handleSpeakTouchEnd"
            catchtouchcancel="handleSpeakTouchEnd"
            aria-role="button"
            aria-label="按住说话"
          >
            <text>按住说话</text>
          </view>
          <input
            wx:else
            class="agent-input"
            value="{{draft}}"
            placeholder="用自己的话讲一讲…"
            placeholder-class="agent-input-placeholder"
            maxlength="1000"
            cursor-spacing="24"
            show-confirm-bar="{{false}}"
            confirm-type="send"
            bindinput="handleInput"
            bindconfirm="handleSend"
            disabled="{{sending}}"
          />
          <view class="agent-send-button {{draft && !voiceMode && !sending ? 'is-enabled' : ''}}" catchtap="handleSend" aria-role="button" aria-label="发送">
            <image class="agent-send-icon" src="{{UA.src(ui, '../../assets/agent-send.svg')}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"></image>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="agent-composer-note-background" aria-hidden="true"></view>
      <text class="agent-composer-note">{{voiceRecognizing ? '松手后录音将上传用于转成文字，识别后不保留录音' : (voiceMode ? '按住说话，用自己的话讲给它听' : '用自己的话讲清楚就好，不用照抄课程原话')}}</text>
    </block>
  </block>
</view>
<checkin-celebration notice="{{checkinNotice}}" close-label="看看验收结果" bind:close="closeCheckinNotice" />
<dev-reset-fab />
